  "title": "Picture naming",
  "description": "Intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings from 108 individuals with epilepsy who performed a picture-naming task, with stimulus-onset and response-onset events marked in each EDF file. Electrode coordinates are provided in MNI-305 (FreeSurfer fsaverage) space. The data were used to study early facilitative and late compensatory neural interactions during naming.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded in EDF format during a picture-naming task. Event codes 401 mark stimulus onset and 501 mark response onset. Electrode coordinates were aligned to the FreeSurfer standard brain (fsaverage/MNI305), in millimeters.",
